cted": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le02ob09re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nResearch endangered species in your country.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le02ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "Across the world, species are disappearing at an astonishing rate. An increasing number of different genuses of birds, fish, and land animals are being declared extinct every year. Making laws to protect these endangered animals has been the focus of many eco-groups. They work to keep the last remaining animals of a species alive.", "id": 1}, {"time": "22000", "image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": "Many species have been put in danger of extinction thanks to the activities of human beings. If humans had been more aware of wildlife preservation in the past, so many species wouldn't have become endangered. In many countries, endangered animals have been hunted for their valuable pelts, feathers, or meat. These products are being sold in markets around the world. So many of the animals have been killed that they are not able to reproduce quickly enough to continue the species.", "id": 2}, {"time": "53000", "image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img03.jpg", "text": "Environmental groups around the world have made us more aware of our behavior. Immediate action has to be taken to protect the last population of many endangered species. Many countries have made laws to prohibit the hunting or killing of endangered animals. There are also laws against deforestation - the permanent destruction of forests.<br/>\nUnfortunately, not everyone is sympathetic to the cause. Many continue to destroy forests, pollute waters, and hunt wild animals for profit. These questions remain: If we lose more species, what will be the environmental cost? If we were to pollute and hunt less, would we see an immediate turn around? If we want answers to these questions, we must act, and act quickly.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}